# XR and AI solutions designed to scale

Immersive training and simulations, digital twins, agentic AI, robotics with enterprise-grade
security

[Play Showreel][15]

Why Clients Choose Us

[See reviews][16]

## Trusted XR Partner

Lucid Reality Labs ranks among the world’s top XR companies. We build enterprise-level XR solutions
for Education, Healthcare, Life Sciences, Manufacturing, Aerospace and FMCG

## Capabilities

### VR

With elements of gamification for various training, education, and collaboration scenarios, where
users can explore, interact, learn and build skills as well as master procedures attached to the
role in a risk-free, controlled environment.

### Agentic AI

We build context-aware AI agents inside hyperrealistic XR environments that coach, assess, and
assist users in real time, improving training, simulation, and on-the-job performance with
enterprise-grade security and compliance

### AR

Real-world enhancement with digital twins and visual overlays that enable countless possibilities
for business across all industries. Our solutions transform the way people perceive information,
play, learn, collaborate, shop, socialize, and explore the world.

### iXR™

Stand for intelligent XR solution that combines Artificial Intelligence and XR Spatial Technology to
provide personalized immersive experiences.

### MR

That merge physical and digital worlds, people, and virtual beings, revealing new opportunities for
human, computer, and environment interactions. We create new forms of remote collaboration,
operations improvement, reskilling, and upskilling of your workforce, while promoting safety and
creativity.

### Prototyping

That enable private and public sector clients to explore and utilize Spatial Computing Technology
opportunities for their business, prototyping new and transforming existing products and solutions.
We advise, design and implement, creating innovative know-how that challenges existing approaches.

